BT /F1 10 Tf 40 750 Td 13 TL (Job Title: Full Stack Software Engineer) ' (Company: InnovateTech Systems) ' (Location: New York, NY / Hybrid) ' (ROLE OVERVIEW:) ' (We are seeking an ambitious Full Stack Developer to build next-generation web applications. You will work across both client-side and server-side systems.) ' (RESPONSIBILITIES:) ' (- Architect and develop scalable web applications using React, TypeScript, and Node.js.) ' (- Build resilient backend microservices with REST APIs and PostgreSQL database storage.) ' (- Manage containerization workflows using Docker and Kubernetes.) ' (- Implement CI/CD deployment pipelines on Amazon Web Services \(AWS\).) ' (- Collaborate in an Agile team with continuous code integration and automated testing.) ' (REQUIRED TECHNICAL SKILLS:) ' (- Proficiency in JavaScript, TypeScript, and Node.js.) ' (- Strong hands-on experience with modern frontend frameworks, specifically React.) ' (- Experience with relational databases \(PostgreSQL or MySQL\) and NoSQL \(MongoDB or Redis\).) ' (- Experience with Docker and container orchestration \(Kubernetes\).) ' (- Familiarity with cloud services on Amazon Web Services \(AWS\) or Google Cloud Platform \(GCP\).) ' (- Experience with REST API design, Git, GitHub, and Agile methodologies.) ' (- Excellent communication, critical thinking, and problem solving skills.) ' ET
